<details>
<summary>Advanced native provider surface</summary>

FileService uses the established owned-buffer, NativeHandle and NativeRequest
protocol. These methods are for framework/provider integrations; ordinary app code
should use the Files module above. A trusted desktop host installs the additive
LuiFiles.h picker bridge before application entry. Dialogs is checked again after
project authority is narrowed. Providers never accept an app-supplied native path.

{{Native}}

</details>
